From: Studio (C1, claude/r4-content)
Subject: [PATCH 018] harness: the beat of the page up, as the seam keeps it (director15 S9b, c6 stuck 18)

Supersedes the S9b half of 017. 017 no longer applies: Brain's own v6.6 P4 already drops the picture request on later parts,
so its S9 half is in. Its S9b half (shownKind) never reached the harness, so the run's harness never told the preselect that
a remediation's board was up.

Root cause of director15 c6 stuck 18 ("picture dikhao" over the remediation's lettered hexagon, then "Screen par ek
aakaar hai…" over the then-card's pentagon): the harness's own model of the seam. evals/hybrid-side-by-side.mjs passes
the preselect avoid and avoidRef but no avoidKind. The run's tree, 2e9664b34, has shownKind 0 times.
- Production: replayed through Brain's planTurn (tests/fixtures/replay.mjs, the director15 lesson) and Studio's seam,
  row 16 reaches the seam as scriptBeat.kind "remediation". Row 18's preselect offers "unrolled", and the turn draws the
  hexagon laid straight (unrolled@1), then the pentagon card.
- The harness's bookkeeping on the same replay: row 18 → the card's measured@1, no second view (the run's row). With this
  patch → unrolled.

This patch keeps shownKind beside shownRef, exactly as seam.js keeps wbPrevKind: the take's lastKind, else its
scriptBeat.kind; a paged turn's lastKind; none when no card ref is up. It passes avoidKind to the preselect.
Pinned: tests/r8-director15.test.mjs.

